---
Create snapshot regression test.

Render a reference project and compare output against a known-good
snapshot to detect audio regressions.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Reference .sqproj file checked into repo
- [ ] Test renders project to WAV
- [ ] Compares output against stored reference WAV (bit-exact or within tolerance)
- [ ] Fails if output differs beyond threshold
- [ ] Reference can be updated with a flag (--update-snapshot)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Run snapshot test, verify passes against reference
- [ ] Intentionally break DSP code, verify test fails
- [ ] Update reference, verify test passes again
